<title>AUSTRIA: Wienerberger to start ADR programme.</title>
<headline>Wienerberger to start ADR programme.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian building materials group Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie said on Thursday it planned to start an American Depository Receipt (ADR) programme on the New York Stock Exchange at the end of the month.</p>
<p>&quot;We're aiming for better shareholder information in the U.S. and increased liquidity,&quot; chief executive Erhard Schaschl told journalists.</p>
</text>
